{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AdEBa5WHsQqYLARq9kyHRu","type":"tool_result","content":"# GEPA Computational Requirements\n\nBased on the documentation, GEPA **does not require a local GPU**—it operates through API calls to external LLM providers.\n\nThe framework is designed as an **API-first system**. As stated in the materials: \"No weights access needed. Optimize GPT-5, Claude, Gemini directly through their APIs.\" This means you interact with proprietary models hosted remotely rather than running inference locally.\n\n## Key efficiency metrics:\n\n- **Minimal evaluations needed**: 100–500 function evaluations compared to 5,000–25,000+ for reinforcement learning approaches\n- **Works with scarce data**: Effective with as few as 3 examples\n- **Model-agnostic**: Compatible with any API-accessible LLM\n\nThe computational bottleneck is the cost of API calls to reflection and task LLMs, not local hardware. Installation is straightforward via pip, making it accessible without specialized infrastructure."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"REDACTED","uuid":"3597195b-802c-4644-b0d7-defda465cd6f","timestamp":"2026-07-29T01:25:55.757Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":465775,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# GEPA Computational Requirements\n\nBased on the documentation, GEPA **does not require a local GPU**—it operates through API calls to external LLM providers.\n\nThe framework is designed as an **API-first system**. As stated in the materials: \"No weights access needed. Optimize GPT-5, Claude, Gemini directly through their APIs.\" This means you interact with proprietary models hosted remotely rather than running inference locally.\n\n## Key efficiency metrics:\n\n- **Minimal evaluations needed**: 100–500 function evaluations compared to 5,000–25,000+ for reinforcement learning approaches\n- **Works with scarce data**: Effective with as few as 3 examples\n- **Model-agnostic**: Compatible with any API-accessible LLM\n\nThe computational bottleneck is the cost of API calls to reflection and task LLMs, not local hardware. Installation is straightforward via pip, making it accessible without specialized infrastructure.","durationMs":5512,"url":"https://github.com/gepa-ai/gepa"}}
